  "company-logo-style": "background-image:url(\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/641d738589b0aa024a1841bf_logo%20client%20(7).avif\")",
  "title-post-2": "How What The Foc?! scaled its business through digital",
  "rt-blog-html": "\n          <p>Welcome to <a href=\"https://what-the-foc.fr/\">What the Foc</a>, the temple of Parisian focaccia! The concept? Original and very tasty focaccia recipes.</p>\n          <p>What the Foc ?! has several activities: take-away, click &amp; collect, delivery and catering.</p>\n          <p>To meet their needs, What the Foc?! called on Innovorder to implement several solutions: an <a href=\"/en/self-ordering-kiosk\">order terminal</a> at their point of sale, a <a href=\"/en/point-of-sales-restaurant\">cash register </a>and <a href=\"/en/online-ordering-for-restaurant\">online ordering</a> on their website.</p>\n          <figure style=\"max-width:6000pxpx\" class=\"w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image\">\n            <div><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"cash register for take-away\" src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/641d73c77c910502db56a6a6_641ad2c21c016368725ec9d7_WTFHD-13-redimensionn%25C3%25A9e.jpeg\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <h4>The history of the project: from a dark kitchen to a take-away</h4>\n          <p>At the helm of this premium sandwich shop in the 17th arrondissement, there are 3 entrepreneurs: Ilan Nakam, Ilan Edelman and Nils Edelman. After a stint in business school and experience in a large group, Nils decided to train at the Ferrandi school. With his diploma in hand, he became a home chef.&nbsp;</p>\n          <p>After several tests and reflections, the trio launches the concept \"<a href=\"https://what-the-foc.fr/\">What the Foc?!</a>\" and opens, at first, a dark kitchen in October 2021. As they miss the contact with the customers, they quickly decide to welcome customers in take-away.</p>\n          <figure style=\"max-width:5821pxpx\" class=\"w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image\">\n            <div><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"chef preparing a focaccia\" src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/641d73c7f46b4996b3018ef7_641ad2f34884710a64911824_WTFHD-18-redimensionn%25C3%25A9e.jpeg\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <h4>Their challenge: to process a large volume of orders efficiently in order to open new points of sale</h4>\n          <p>In January 2023, the three founders appeared on the M6 show \"Qui veut être mon associé? As a result, sales soared!&nbsp;</p>\n          <p>Their ambition is to open new points of sale in Paris, to become a franchisee in a second phase and cover all of France. Aware that digital technology would meet their development ambitions, they decided to call on Innovorder.&nbsp;</p>\n          <p>Nils confides: </p>\n          <blockquote>\"Before, we worked in a very traditional way, we wrote everything down by hand. But when you want to set up several restaurants, scalability is the key. It has to be fast to process a considerable volume. This has been our objective from the start and Innovorder is able to meet it.</blockquote>\n          <h4>An order terminal to save time for teams and customers</h4>\n          <p>The <a href=\"/en/self-ordering-kiosk\">kiosk</a> located at the point of sale allows the team to free up time to serve customers, advise them, or help in the kitchen during rushes. Today, it centralizes <strong>30% of the volume of orders</strong>. </p>\n          <blockquote>\"The terminal saves us a lot of time. When there are big rushes, it's a lifesaver!\"</blockquote>\n          <figure style=\"max-width:6000pxpx\" class=\"w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image\">\n            <div><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Order terminal at What the Foc ?!\" src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/641d73c71591085bb45755bc_641ad251ac3aee72e86b7d23_WTFHD-5-redimensionn%25C3%25A9e.jpeg\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <p>This is also a very positive result for the customers: the queues are shorter and the customers are more satisfied!&nbsp;</p>\n          <h4>A close and reactive support</h4>\n          <p>With Innovorder's support for the <a href=\"/en/point-of-sales-restaurant\">cash register</a>, <a href=\"/en/online-ordering-for-restaurant\">online ordering</a> and <a href=\"/en/self-ordering-kiosk\">point-of-sale order taking</a>, the What the Foc?! team can focus on the kitchen and the customers.&nbsp;</p>\n          <blockquote>\"What makes our life easier is that Innovorder's support is very good. The teams are very responsive.</blockquote>\n          <p>-</p>\n          <p>You are a restaurant owner and you are looking for a solution to simplify your life and to manage large volumes with complete peace of mind?</p>\n          <p>👉 <a href=\"/en/commercial-catering/independant\"><strong>Discover our expertise for fast food!</strong></a></p>\n        ",
